"""
A Bunti code (Wolly.Bunti) of a text as a PNG file, read back from the file
as a check:

    buntipng FILE TEXT

It encodes TEXT at level M in mode 1, draws the code at 8 pixels a cell
with Wolly.Image, writes the PNG to FILE (an old FILE is replaced), reads
the file again and decodes the PNG with Wolly.BuntiScan.  It prints the
size of the code in cells, the bytes of the PNG and the verdict, and exits
0 only when the text read back from the file is TEXT; otherwise it says
why not and exits 1.
"""
module Wolly.Example.BuntiPng is
    """
    The command of the arguments.
    No contract: the outcome is the result of I/O.
    """
    function main(root: RootCapability): ExitCode;
end module.
